&lt;li&gt;Develop and verify technical security controls that satisfy multiple compliance frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with security, infrastructure, and product engineering teams to translate compliance requirements into effective technical controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute control testing procedures to assess control performance, surface gaps, and verify that remediation is complete&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish repeatable control assessments and continuous monitoring processes to evaluate compliance effectiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate security requirements into structured, machine-readable JSON definitions to support control management, testing, and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain API integrations and automated workflows to streamline evidence collection, control validation, and compliance processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve control effectiveness, reduce manual effort, and scale compliance operations across multiple frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
