&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience in security compliance, security assurance, IT audit, or compliance engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with security compliance frameworks, including FedRAMP, SOC 2, ISO 27001, and NIST 800-53, designing, implementing, and testing technical security controls in SaaS or cloud environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience testing security controls for design and operating performance, including surfacing gaps and confirming fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of cloud security concepts, including identity and access management, vulnerability management, logging, and security configurations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with engineering teams to implement compliance requirements as technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with JSON, REST APIs, and automation, applied to compliance engineering challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
