&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing JSON-based control definitions, JSON Schema, or machine-readable compliance documentation, and REST API integrations and custom automation workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Open Security Controls Assessment Language (OSCAL)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python or similar scripting languages for compliance automation, including experience with compliance automation platforms and automated evidence collection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Git, version control, and collaborative development workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with cloud security technologies, particularly AWS&lt;/li&gt;
